 ight is a relaxed event with revolving themes and materials. The price for
  this event is on a sliding scale. We trust that everyone will choose the 
 price they are able to pay\, no questions asked. We want to make this even
 t as accessible as possible\, if price is a barrier please feel free to re
 ach out to us. ‍
