BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Ladylike Jam III: Forest + Celeste
DTSTART:20260507T200000
DTEND:20260507T200000
UID:38c5206c9d8709ce23fe464b1d2f85cc@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:The 3rd installment of the Ladylike Jam\, an open jam+art mark
 et that serves to spotlight female-identifying &amp\; queer artists in Tor
 onto. Sliding scale ticket prices available upon request!! Forest &amp\; C
 eleste are sisters singing together and dreaming of a more magical\, whims
 ical and liberated future! Forest Hope is a vocalist\, songwriter and mult
 idisciplinary artist. Her work explores the self\, ancestry\, nature\, dre
 aming\, improvisation and themes of liberation. She is a member of the col
 lective @sobf_collective\, and host and co-creator of the former Hot Sprin
 g jam. Celeste Van Winkle is vocalist and songwriter embarking on her jour
 ney as an emerging artist in Toronto. She is always writing and producing 
 new songs\, and through her music wants to give voice to her polyamorous p
 erspectives\, and the fight for decolonization. She has an ongoing residen
 cy at Tranzac Club on the 3rd Sunday of every month. Forest and Celeste wi
 ll be accompanied by Vee Lee\, Jessie Lynne\, Camille Ari Love\, Dora M\, 
 and April. ‍
LOCATION:The Root Down Studio\, 225 Geary Ave
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/the-ladylike-jam-iii-forest-celeste
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
