 in America Ever wanted to join a book club\, but you don’t like reading?
  Ever listened to an album and wanted to talk about it for hours\, but had
  no one to gab with? REPEAT is for you! Each month\, we pick a new album t
 o break down- this month&#x27\;s album is Wor$t Girl in America by Slayyyt
 er. We’ll chat about it\, do some music trivia\, play some games\, watch
  some performances of select songs by host Matte Black and decide…IS THI
 S ALBUM ON REPEAT?? Take a look at the pinned post at @repeattoronto on IG
  for more deets and FAQs!! This month\, we&#x27\;ll have special giveaways
  from Dead Dog Records and more! See you there 😍😍😍 ‍
LOCATION:Mama&#x27\;s Liquor and Lounge\, 1602 Dundas Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/repeat-a-queer-book-club-for-albums
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
