SUMMARY:WILL MUNRO and an ARMY of LOVERS
DTSTART:20260516T123000
DTEND:20260516T123000
UID:6b63e0c458f4a6e561a2a279776eeab8@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:May 16 COLLECTIVE CITY PRESENTS: WILL MUNRO and an ARMY of LOV
 ERS 12:30 -2:30 REVUE CINEMA 400 Roncesvalles Ave. Collective City will be
  premiering 2 new Short Docs at the Revue Cinema: Will Munro (and an Army 
 of Lovers) and The Making of The Plumb. We will also be showing one of our
  previous docs - Outlaw Neon as Orest Tataryn (one of the members of Outla
 w Neon) Over the last few years\, Dave Sylvestre and Richard Mongait have 
 spent hours interviewing folks close to Will. Discovering how Will was abl
 e to merge and meld every world he chose to interact with for this Documen
 tary. He brought crafts to the uncrafty\, punk ethos to the refined and ac
 tivism to the inert. All set to the beat of a constantly escalating musica
 l sound track so technically positioned that every song was in fact a cult
 ural history lesson. To make this even a bit more Will’ish… it’s FRE
 E! #willmunro #collectivecity #davemunro ‍
LOCATION:The Revue Cinema\, 400 Roncesvalles Ave
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/will-munro-and-an-army-of-lovers
