BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dykeumentary Night: Not Quite That (WITH Q&amp\;A)
DTSTART:20260518T193000
DTEND:20260518T193000
UID:28f918d91c6302955f551961e0e1797f@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:The story of a nice Jewish butch lesbian with a genetic mutati
 on that just might allow her to be fully seen at last. Dykeumentary Night 
 is a monthly lesbian film screening series hosted in Toronto at Three Doll
 ar Bill. May&#x27\;s movie is Not Quite That. Might a genetic mutation be 
 the very thing that allows this nice Jewish butch lesbian to be fully seen
  at last? Meet Sarah\, 57. Lesbian? For sure. Jewish? Yes and no. Mother? 
 In all but one sense. Trans? No\, just often mistaken as such. Breast canc
 er survivor? Well\, that’s the plan\, the survival bit\, but without the
  cancer or the breasts. Not Quite That is an intimate and insightful explo
 ration of how we are seen\, how we see ourselves\, and why it matters. Dev
 eloped with the support of Creative BC and the CMPA-BC (Equity and Emergin
 g Development Program). Produced with the support of TELUS originals and w
 ith the participation of the Government of Canada\, Canadian Film or Video
  Production Tax Credit\, and the Province of British Columbia\, Film Incen
 tive BC. Director: Ali Grant Run Time: 47 min Come out\, celebrate our les
 bian and dyke community\, and watch some phenomenal (and often hard-to-fin
 d) documentaries with others like you. Popcorn included! Hosted by Sofie M
 ikhaylova\, comic\, events organizer\, and more. @sofiehaha13 ‍
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/dykeumentary-night-not-quite-that-with-q-a
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
