DTEND:20260522T200000
UID:a518b3b15675f389b2d6711a833dbe17@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:/lineup Theysii Sela Vie MSDELICIOUS B2B orkid Sulk Hogan (2) 
 B2B Tiger Lightning Recuerdo esa evocación… acariciándome en tu ambien
 te\, nubes que me alzan cerca tu espíritu\, brisa que me desahoga\; mi pe
 nsamiento no me insiste. La tierra\, aunque no bajo mí\, dirigiéndome\, 
 fundamenta. ˙⋆✮ੈ✩‧₊˚ Our crew is pulling together another DI
 Y spectacle\, this time in collaboration with our friends over at Querenci
 a Studio To celebrate 2 years of their private studio\, they’re opening 
 up their doors to friends\, extended chosen family\, and strangers soon to
  be acquaintances. Querencia is a space born out of reckless desire and a 
 passion for DIY spaces in the city\; it promises to work with folks who wa
 nt to create in this city and make it possible to access a space to host i
 n. It’s an open space\, ripe for transfiguration. In this space artists 
 adorn bodies\; a dear and intimate process. Organizers orchestrate assembl
 y in the ways of art\, cause\, union\, dance. Clients and guests each part
 icipants in bringing life into the space. &amp\; of course\, many backstag
 e supporters make this all possible. As a huge thank you we invite you to 
 come and party party party with us! For our inquisitive pals out there who
  have yet to check out the space\, this event is welcome to all\, doors op
 en to folks wanting to say hi or see what the space is all about. The stud
 io open house soirée will evolve into the night…. As our bodies fill th
 e space with heat &amp\; our feet urge us to hit the floor with a groove\,
  our hypnotic selectors will beckon us into euphoric dance Joining our res
 idents @sulkhogan and @tigerlightning: @msdeliciouslive and @sillylilorkid
  known for tearing down diy dance floors with their eclectic blends @theys
 iii - head of Transient Radio serving funky melodies\, housey beats\, and 
 bass for your soul @djselavie with high-powered dance perfect for anyone w
 ho is ready to groove ✧.* ‍
