DTSTART:20260523T140000
DTEND:20260523T140000
UID:e2c80a1dbad78aac059fffcca7f92b0e@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Leatherqueer Picnic Saturday May 3rd\, 2-5pm. *If it
 ’s raining\, we’ll reschedule for another time. This is a space for le
 atherqueers of marginalized genders to connect\, make friends\, and cruise
 . Flagging is encouraged! We will have optional name tags and icebreaker p
 rompts to help folks mingle comfortably. We’ll gather in the southwest c
 orner of the park\, near Banjara. Look for the Leather Pride flag to find 
 us! This spot in the park is mixed sun and shade and has flat\, uneven gra
 ssy ground. If you like\, bring yourself a camp chair\, picnic blanket\, p
 illow\, snacks\, whatever you’d like to have to enjoy a nice afternoon i
 n the park. Let’s be comfortable! A note on C0v1D: the limited data we h
 ave makes it difficult to assess the severity of this ongoing pandemic. Le
 t’s practice caring safety protocols and give each other ample space. Br
 ing a mask in case you want to get closer to skill-share or cruise etc. *I
 f someone is wearing a mask\, wear one to approach them.* If you have any 
 symptoms of illness or known/suspected recent exposures\, please don’t c
 ome. Let’s make sure we have a healthy tomorrow to meet again in the fut
 ure. Christie Pits is at 750 Bloor St W in Toronto. It is accessible by ca
 r with street and lot parking nearby\, by subway via Line 2 at Christie st
 ation and by bus via route 126. There are two\, gendered\, wheelchair-acce
 ssible washrooms at the bottom of a steep hill with a paved path. Your org
 anizers are @hollys_horny_home @pansybutch &amp\; @thekikikennedy. Inspire
 d by similar gatherings across turtle island\, with acknowledgement &amp\;
  appreciation to @mother.archetype &amp\; @_wolfsmilk._ .\, @monster_femme
 \, @sharonpinkishere\, @daemonumx\, @chicagoleatherdykepicnic\, and many o
 thers. ‍
LOCATION:Christie Pits Park\, 750 Bloor Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/toronto-leatherqueer-picnic-2
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
