 t’s the story coming to life in real time. Hosted by Tamara Shevon and f
 eaturing performances by Halo Vair\, Childlike\, and Damian Rose ft. Egos 
 Body\, with DJ sets by Miri and Jayne Dice keeping the energy flowing all 
 night. Expect a dreamy\, electric atmosphere art\, music\, and feeling all
  in one room. ‍
