 e Drink on Church Street for a night built by and for sapphic energy. Door
 s open at 10PM\, and we’re bringing you a high-vibe\, unapologetically q
 ueer dance floor where WLW\, non-binary\, and trans folks are centered\, c
 elebrated\, and free to fully be themselves. Expect nothing but bangers as
  DJ Mar spins a nonstop set of pop hits to keep you moving all night long.
  The energy doesn’t stop there—live pop-up performances from Xtacy Lov
 e and Nicki Nastasia will keep the crowd electrified\, while our sexy Go G
 o dancers raise the temperature even higher. This space is intentionally c
 urated to feel safe\, affirming\, and electric for sapphic communities. To
  help maintain that atmosphere\, all cis men must be accompanied by at lea
 st two sapphic people. This isn’t about exclusion—it’s about protect
 ing the vibe and ensuring that those who often don’t get centered in nig
 htlife spaces can feel prioritized\, respected\, and at ease. By setting t
 his tone\, we create an environment where people can dance\, connect\, and
  express themselves without hesitation. Tickets: $20 Pull up in your flann
 el\, your femme\, or anywhere in between—just bring your energy. Let’s
  make it a night that’s bold\, sweaty\, and unforgettable. ‍
