 ted for FLINTA* and BIPOC queers to have a space for sexy movement and exp
 ression. An all queer-femme DJ lineup will have you dancing all night long
 \, Booty Bouncing Bangers guaranteed from open to close. This will be the 
 2nd iteration of B00TY C4LL\, we are looking forward to it becoming an ann
 ual affair. DJs Disthene MS. MYLES Kara Kara GRRLCRRSH Stella Maise About 
 EXPOSURE THER4PY Travelling through a variety of musical landscapes\, Expo
 sure Ther4py is a genre fluid event series that encourages party-goers to 
 step out of their comfort zone. Queer Pride 2026 June 5 – 28\, 2026 WE
 ’RE BACK DIVAS &lt\;3 It’s Queer Pride 2026 and Buddies and Buddies Ni
 ghtlife are teaming up to make HERstory with our messiest\, most maximalis
 t Pride yet. We’ve got a full month line-up of extremely queer parties\,
  raves\, cabarets\, concerts\, and comedy. No matter what flavour you brin
 g\, there’s room for you in our alphabet soup \;) Join us on the biggest
  dance floor in the village for the best of queer culture in Toronto and b
 eyond. Thank you to our Government Partner\, Canadian Heritage\, and our G
 old Sponsor\, Freddie\, for making the 2026 Queer Pride Festival possible!
  ‍
LOCATION:Buddies in Bad Times\, 12 Alexander St
