BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gay AF Comedy Pride-Stravaganza
DTSTART:20260613T150000
DTEND:20260613T150000
UID:ef0123e4241e2114ef6a51a3b572feb0@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Gay AF Comedy Pride-Stravaganza is back at Campbell House Muse
 um for its 5th year! Come join the funny for some big Queer laughs! Gay AF
  Comedy Pride-Stravaganza is taking over the stunning Campbell House Museu
 m gardens for an All-Star Outdoor Queer Comedy event\, with headliner and 
 Queer comedy treasure MARTHA CHAVES! Now in our 5th year of fantastic fier
 ce fun! Known for serving fabulous comic lineups that “will make your ja
 w drop” (She Does The City)\, Gay AF is Toronto’s premiere place for A
 -List headliners and a Queer cornucopia of supporting acts. Enjoy free sam
 pling by our exclusive drinks sponsor Cottage Springs Beverage Co. and exp
 erience some of Canada’s top Queer comedic talent in a wonderful outdoor
  setting. Hosted by Canadian Comedy Award winner ROBERT WATSON with headli
 ner MARTHA CHAVES\, along with Gay AF faves BEE BERTRAND\, NILE SEGUIN\, T
 AMARA APPLETON &amp\; MIKAEL MELO! “Queer and Hilarious\, with BDE” 
 – My Gay Toronto “a joyful event with a little something for everyone
 ” – Parton &amp\; Pearl “featuring top-notch queer comedians who rep
 resent the many intersections of the LGBTQ2S+ community.” – IN Magazin
 e Come Join The Funny this Pride! Saturday June 13. Gates 2pm / Show 3pm. 
 The Campbell House Museum Outdoor Gardens. 160 Queen Street West (Near Osg
 oode Subway Station). Tickets $30. Accessibility While the outdoor gardens
  are uneven in places they are accessible for mobility devices. Washrooms 
 are located inside the museum down a flight of stairs. Museum Building Acc
 essibility If rain moves our show indoors on June 13\, the performance wil
 l take place in the 2nd floor ballroom of the museum\, which is unfortunat
 ely not accessible for mobility devices. Notice will be given 36 hours in 
 advance. We apologize for this inconvenience. Please contact Campbell Hous
 e if you have any accessibility questions. Refund and Exchange Policy: All
  ticket sales are final and nonrefundable. Exchanges may be granted under 
 extenuating circumstances at the discretion of Campbell House Museum and G
 ay AF Comedy. Please send an email to info@campbellhousemuseum.ca with any
  requests. ‍
LOCATION:Campbell House Museum\, 160 Queen St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/gay-af-comedy-pride-stravaganza-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
